  "text": {
    "paragraphs": [
      "This is Mia. Mia is a girl. Mia has a new pet. It is a puppy. The puppy is small. Its name is Pip. Pip is a happy puppy. Pip is white. Pip is soft. This puppy is nice. Mia loves Pip. Pip has a red ball. This red ball is Pip's toy. Pip likes this toy.",
      "Mia feeds Pip. Pip eats food. Pip likes its food. This is Pip's food. Mia gives water. Pip drinks water. Pip plays. Mia plays with Pip. Pip runs. Pip runs fast. This puppy is fun. Pip is a good puppy. Mia is good to Pip. Mia likes Pip.",
      "Pip has a bed. This is Pip's bed. Pip sleeps in its bed. Mia gives Pip a toy. Pip plays with its toy. Pip is a happy puppy. Mia is happy too. This is my friend. My friend is Pip. Pip is my good puppy. Mia and Pip are friends. This friendship is strong. Mia loves her friend."
    ],
